Categories with +load methods merged as Xcode 27.0's ld merges them (B-193, docs/formats/build.md "Objective-C
references, archive members and hints in the linked image"): into a class of the image when the class and its
categories have one +load method at most, the class then listed in __objc_nlclslist; a class of a dylib with a +load
category keeps all its categories unmerged. lld left every category of __objc_nlcatlist out of merging and merged the
other categories of such a class into one.
